---
/**
 * The grid of the post's pages, two cards to a row on the wide track, as the
 * works of a portfolio. Each card is a Page.
 */
---
<div class="wide"><ul class="pages"><slot /></ul></div>

<style>
  /* More room around the grid than between paragraphs, so that the text
     after it does not read as the caption of its last row. */
  .wide { margin-top: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 2.25rem; }
  .pages {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
